'''''Gennaria''''' is a [[genus]] of [[flowering plant]]s in the orchid family, [[Orchidaceae]]. For many years it contained only one species, ''[[Gennaria diphylla]]''. A second species, ''[[Gennaria griffithii]]'', was added in 2015.<ref name=POWO_29541-1/> The genus name honours [[Patrizio Gennari]],<ref name=DorrNich09/> Italian botanist and patriot.

==Species==
{{As of|2018|March}}, two species are accepted:<ref name=POWO_29541-1/>
* ''[[Gennaria diphylla]]'' {{small|Link) Parl.}} – [[Macaronesia]], north-west Africa, south-west Europe
* ''[[Gennaria griffithii]]'' {{small|(Hook.f.) X.H.Jin & D.Z.Li}} – [[Afghanistan]] to [[China]]

